Fortune data
============

fortunes/ in this repository, and data/fortunes.json in the published package,
are a subset of the fortune database distributed with fortune-mod 1.99.1. The BSD
3-Clause terms above apply to this project's code only; they are not asserted
over the fortune data, and the individual quotations are not owned by this
project.

The only statement upstream makes about the database is in its Notes file,
carried over from NetBSD. Both that file and the 4-clause license notice from
upstream's `fortune/fortune.c` are shipped verbatim in
third-party/fortune-mod-1.99.1/:

    The fortunes contained in the fortune database have been collected
    haphazardly from a cacophony of sources, in number so huge it boggles the
    mind. It is impossible to do any meaningful quality control on
    attributions, or lack thereof, or exactness of the quote. Since this
    database is not used for profit, and since entire works are not published,
    it falls under fair use, as we understand it.
